5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"We need a fair system, but we should be careful not to create unnecessary tension among the residents.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, dear. It would be lovely if we could find a way that makes everyone feel comfortable and happy.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Let's be real, ""fair"" usually means something concrete. I'm curious about the money side of things. Who's actually paying for what?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,We must ensure the system is sustainable. It's no use creating a rule that becomes a burden for one person to manage.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I've heard some people grumbling that the same people always get the best spots! I want to know if that's actually true!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, if we focus too much on ""who gets what,"" we might end up with more complaints.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,Perhaps we should look at how the bikes are actually being used every day? It might give us a clue.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"Exactly! And while we're at it, let's see if there's any money sitting in the accounts that we're ignoring.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,I'm more concerned with the administrative side. I want to see how the collections were handled in the past.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"But if it's unfair, we have to fix it! I want to see who is actually using the spaces right now.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm worried about the long-term atmosphere. I'd like to know if similar rules caused problems in the past.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"That's a very thoughtful point, Misaki. I'll also look into the physical layout to see if that's causing any stress.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I'll take the lead on the finances. Let's see if we can turn this parking headache into something productive for the building.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,George,,I'll look into the handover files. I want to know exactly how much paperwork this requires on a monthly basis.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm going to check the records! I want to see if the bikes are actually where they're supposed to be.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Let's gather the facts first. I'll look into the history of the association and the complaints.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I think we have a good plan. Let's see what we find and come back with a smile.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,Perfect. I'll find out where the money is hiding. See you all in a bit!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,George,,Agreed. Let's be thorough so we don't have to redo this in six months.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,"Yay! I can't wait to see if my hunch about the ""favorite spots"" is right!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
