35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It seems the current arrangement is stagnant, and people are avoiding direct confrontation even when they're annoyed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I noticed that it's quite a struggle in the mornings. Some neighbors have to move other bikes just to get out.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,Here's the thing: we're barely using our building account. Why aren't we charging for these spaces to build a fund?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,George,,I've seen the handover files. The current cash collection is already a chore. Adding more billing will be a burden.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,I saw it too! People are shifting each other's bikes! And the register is a mess—some people have three bikes but only one spot!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, if we start policing the number of bikes too strictly, we might create a hostile environment in the lobby.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"I'm worried about the rain, too. Some spots are just not very kind to the bicycles. It's a bit sad.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, a little extra paperwork is a small price to pay for a fair system that actually brings in money.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,George,,"It's not just ""paperwork,"" May. It's the risk of the system collapsing when the person in charge gets tired.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,But it's not fair that some people just take up space while others can't even park! We need a fresh start!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If we force a ""fresh start"" without care, we might lose the friendly nods we have now. We need a soft transition.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with Misaki. Maybe we can find a way that doesn't feel like a punishment, but a helping hand.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"A ""helping hand"" doesn't pay for building repairs. Let's be pragmatic. If you want a spot, you pay for the privilege.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,George,,"I'm still skeptical. If the administrative load is too high, the system will just lapse like the last two projects did.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,I don't care about the paperwork! I care that the same people always get the easy spots. We need to shake things up!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,Let's consider how the options affect our daily interactions. I don't want people timing their exits to avoid each other.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"Yes, the morning rush is already a bit like a shoving match. We should make it gentler for everyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"I'll bet most residents would prefer a clear, paid system over this chaotic ""first-come, first-served"" mess.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,George,,I will support any option that minimizes the recurring monthly effort for the association members.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I just want everyone to have an equal chance! No more ""secret"" favorite spots for the same people!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
